-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), §11 שעות למורות אם: a mother teacher under
-- the reform who cuts her teaching hours works annex א's week; one who
-- keeps the week she would have had is paid on a position 7% larger; the
-- definition of a mother teacher, her tenure and her claims stay as they
-- were; and this section replaces the earlier "mother hours" provisions.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`

§ `11 שעות למורות אם`

-- (א): a mother teacher under the reform who cuts her teaching hours for
-- being a mother, by the collective agreements on it, works the week annex
-- א' sets out. Annex א' is a section of this agreement not encoded yet:
-- its week is a fact of the case until it is.
@ref akn:art_11__para_a
GIVEN `the week annex א' gives her` IS A `Oz work week`
GIVETH A `Oz work week`
DECIDE `a mother teacher's week who cuts her hours` `the week annex א' gives her` IS
    `the week annex א' gives her`

`why a mother teacher's week is an input` MEANS
    `not yet encoded` "נספח א' להסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), טבלאות שבוע עבודה למורות אימהות"

-- (ב): a mother teacher who goes on working the week she would have had
-- were she not a mother (the same hours of each kind) is paid on a
-- position "הגדול ב – 7% משיעורו בפועל", as annex א' details. Annex א's
-- tables for (ב) add 7 points to the position (96.25% is paid as 103.25%,
-- 87.50% as 94.50%), where the share reading of convention amounts.increase
-- would give 102.99%: the annex, which §1 makes part of the agreement and
-- (ב) itself points to, decides (F-oz-founding-11-a).
@ref akn:art_11__para_b
GIVEN `the position she works` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the position a mother keeping her week is paid on` `the position she works` IS
    `the position she works` PLUS 7%

-- (ג): the definition of "מורה אם" stays as it was on the eve of the
-- signing: it is the earlier collective agreements', and whether a teacher
-- is one is a fact of the case.
@ref akn:art_11__para_c
`why who is a mother teacher is an input` MEANS
    `set elsewhere` "ההגדרה של \"מורה אם\" בהסכמים הקיבוציים, כפי שהייתה ערב חתימת ההסכם (13.8.2011)"

-- (ד): employment under this section, up to a position of 107% ("למען
-- הסר ספק"), needs no special approval of the Ministry under §14. 107% is
-- the position the section itself gives a full-time mother ((ב)), so it
-- is in: an exception to convention thresholds.until.
@ref akn:art_11__para_d
GIVEN `the position she is paid on` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 11(ד) spares the Ministry's approval` `the position she is paid on` IF
    `the position she is paid on` AT MOST 107%

-- (ה): the larger position for pay does not touch the position she has
-- tenure in.
@ref akn:art_11__para_e
GIVEN `the position she works` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the position a mother's tenure is in` `the position she works` IS
    `the position she works`

-- (ו): a change of up to 3% in the position, from a mother's move from the
-- week in force on the eve of the signing to the reform's, founds no claim
-- of a breach of the commitment to the position. "עד 3%" is the most the
-- clause tolerates, so 3% is in (an exception to convention
-- thresholds.until); the change is in points of a position (convention
-- position.points).
@ref akn:art_11__para_f
GIVEN `the position before the move` IS A NUMBER, `the position after the move` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a mother's change of position founds a claim` `the position before the move` `the position after the move` IF
    `the position before the move` MINUS `the position after the move` GREATER THAN 3%
    OR `the position after the move` MINUS `the position before the move` GREATER THAN 3%

-- (ז): for mothers under the reform, this section replaces the provisions
-- on "שעות אם" or "תוספת אם" in the collective agreements in force on the
-- eve of the signing, in what it settles.
@ref akn:art_11__para_g
GIVEN `under the reform` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 11 replaces the earlier mother-hours provisions` `under the reform` IF
    `under the reform`

§§ `11 -- illustrations`

#ASSERT `the position a mother keeping her week is paid on` (100%) EQUALS (107%)
#ASSERT `section 11(ד) spares the Ministry's approval` (`the position a mother keeping her week is paid on` (100%))
#ASSERT NOT `a mother's change of position founds a claim` (100%) (97%)
#ASSERT `the position a mother's tenure is in` (96.25%) EQUALS (96.25%)

-- F-oz-founding-11-a: annex א's tables for (ב) pay 96.25% as 103.25% and
-- 87.50% as 94.50% — 7 points more — where 7% of the position more would
-- be 102.99% and 93.63%.
GIVEN worked IS A NUMBER, paid IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the annex pays 7 points more, not 7 percent more, on` worked paid IF
        `the position a mother keeping her week is paid on` worked EQUALS paid
    AND NOT worked `increased by` (7%) EQUALS paid

#ASSERT `the annex pays 7 points more, not 7 percent more, on` (96.25%) (103.25%) AND `the annex pays 7 points more, not 7 percent more, on` (87.50%) (94.50%)
